# This directory is the former home of the combined compute-browser-use
# stack, which was split into deploy/compute-use and deploy/astrbot.
#
# All tracked content moved out or was deleted. What remains on disk is
# local scratch only, and it must stay ignored so it can never be
# committed by accident — `external/` alone is ~1.2 GB of cloned
# upstream repositories and research notes.
#
# Once you have decided what to do with external/, the whole directory
# can be deleted.
external/
.env
.omo/
.codegraph
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
build/
*.egg-info/
